        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**AWS as referee.** Every other panel in this project is the system measuring itself. These panels are measured by AWS: **CloudWatch EC2 metrics** (the hypervisor's own packet and byte counters for each host) and **VPC Flow Logs** (a record of every flow on every network interface). If maglev-lb's own counters, or the DSR claim, were wrong, these would disagree.\n\nCloudWatch delivers the LB's metrics every minute and the other hosts' every 5 minutes; flow logs arrive a few minutes late. Refresh is 1 min to keep CloudWatch API use at a few cents. Back to the [live dashboard](/d/maglev-lb-cloud)."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Do the LB's own counters agree with AWS?",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "GRE packets the LB forwarded, per minute: maglev-lb's count vs AWS's",
      "description": "maglev-lb counts each packet it encapsulates and sends to a backend. AWS counts every packet leaving the LB's network interface, which also includes the host's own traffic (health checks, SSH, Prometheus scrapes), so its line sits a small, steady amount above. The exact per-packet check is cloud/dsr-proof.sh, which counts only GRE in the VPC Flow Logs.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "datasource",
        "uid": "-- Mixed --"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus-cloud"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(maglev_lb_tx_packets_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "maglev-lb forwarded"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "cloudwatch",
            "uid": "cloudwatch"
          },
          "queryMode": "Metrics",
          "region": "default",
          "namespace": "AWS/EC2",
          "metricName": "NetworkPacketsOut",
          "dimensions": {
            "InstanceId": "__LB__"
          },
          "statistic": "Sum",
          "period": "60",
          "matchExact": true,
          "metricQueryType": 0,
          "metricEditorMode": 0,
          "id": "",
          "expression": "",
          "label": "AWS: all packets out of the LB"
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "sum"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
